{"full":"hf:hugging-apps/pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo","spaceId":"hugging-apps/pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo","name":"Pruna-Qwen-Image-2.1 — 5/8-step Qwen-Image-2.1","source":"huggingface","description":"5/8-step distilled Qwen-Image-2.1 T2I + editing","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["gradio","text-to-image","image-editing","distillation","mcp-server","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":3,"created":"2026-09-24T18:36:12.000Z","updated":"2026-09-25T12:39:31.000Z","license":"other","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://hugging-apps-pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:37.275Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:37.275Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:37.275Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚡","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A DMD-distillation LoRA from Pruna that runs Qwen-Image-2.1 in 5 or 8 sampling steps with no classifier-free guidance, against the base model's 40 — the same pipeline, a fraction of the time. One model does both tasks, exactly as the base does: leave the reference slots empty for text-to-image, or attach one to three reference images for editing / composition / style transfer.","The distillation recipe is reproduced exactly as published on the model card: the card's raw sigma nodes are passed as sigmas= on a scheduler rebuilt with usedynamicshifting=False, shift=1.0, shiftterminal=None (the stock Qwen-Image-2.1 scheduler ships usedynamicshifting=true and shiftterminal=0.02, which would shift the given sigmas a second time and stretch the terminal node), truecfgscale=1.0 with no negative prompt, LoRA strength 1.0, and condition images encoded at 1024-area (outputresolution=1024). Trained at 1K resolution, so the size menu offers 1024-area buckets for every aspect…","Known limits (from the card). This is v0.1 — quality is below the 40-step base model; short or vague text-to-image prompts give weaker results (write detailed ones); other step counts, schedules, or CFG values are not supported."],"features":["8-step adapter — recommended default, higher quality.","5-step adapter — fastest; the card notes visibly lower quality.","Each adapter is trained on its own sigma schedule, so the app loads exactly one at a time and"],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f246ddc4df3bb76f74e420e8b144f1208000013e18f05dea182bdfb5b6f8dbf1","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:37.348Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:37.348Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A DMD-distillation LoRA from Pruna that runs Qwen-Image-2.1 in 5 or 8 sampling steps with no classifier-free guidance, against the base model's 40 — the same pipeline, a fraction of the time. One model does both tasks, exactly as the base does: leave the reference slots empty for text-to-image, or attach one to three reference images for editing / composition / style transfer.","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f246ddc4df3bb76f74e420e8b144f1208000013e18f05dea182bdfb5b6f8dbf1","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:37.348Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-25T12:39:31.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/hugging-apps/pruna-qwen-image-2-1-demo/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:37.348Z","hash":"f246ddc4df3bb76f74e420e8b144f1208000013e18f05dea182bdfb5b6f8dbf1","originalBytes":3170,"storedBytes":3170,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["step","license","qwen-image-2.1","model","reference","adapter","base","card","one","qwen","shift","exactly","images","pruna-qwen-image-2.1","research","termin